---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { T, TICKETS_CHECKED } from '../../data/tickets.js';
---
<Base title="How to buy RWC 2027 tickets safely" description="Official Rugby World Cup 2027 ticket channels, current sale phase, resale info and scam warnings.">
<h1>Buying tickets safely</h1>
<p class="note"><b>Only buy from official channels.</b> Per the organisers, tickets obtained from unauthorised sources are invalid and entry will be denied. ScrumTrip does not sell tickets. Last checked: {TICKETS_CHECKED}.</p>
<h2>Official channels</h2>
<div class="guide">
<section><h3>🎟 Official ticketing</h3><p>RWC 2027 Official Ticketing Website, run by official ticketing partner Ticketmaster Sport. You need a ticketing account (create and activate it first).</p><a class="btn small tix" href={T.official} target="_blank" rel="noopener">tickets.rugbyworldcup.com ↗</a></section>
<section><h3>🥂 Hospitality & ticket + hotel</h3><p>Rugby World Cup Experiences is the Official Provider of Premium Experiences & Travel. Every package includes official match tickets; every match is available.</p><a class="btn small" href={T.hospitality} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Browse by match ↗</a></section>
<section><h3>✈ Official Travel Agents</h3><p>Ticket-inclusive travel packages are sold only by appointed Official Travel Agents, listed on the official Experiences site.</p><a class="btn small" href={T.agents} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Official agent list ↗</a></section>
<section><h3>🔁 Resale / transfer</h3><p>Tickets aren't refundable. An <b>official resale service</b> will open closer to the tournament on the official ticketing website. It isn't live yet.</p><a class="btn small ghost" href={T.resale} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Official help article ↗</a></section>
</div>
<h2>Current sale phase</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Presale</b> opened 18 Feb 2026. <b>Visa Priority Sale</b>: 28–30 Sep 2026 (eligible Visa card only).</li>
<li><b>Now:</b> remaining tickets on general sale since 1 Oct 2026, 12:00 AEST (04:00 SAST), first-come, first-served while available.</li>
<li>More than half of tickets were sold by 30 Sep 2026 (1.3 million, fans from 164 countries).</li>
<li>Prices start at AUD 40 (adult) / AUD 20 (child, ages 3–15). No booking or handling fees, but your bank may add a foreign-transaction fee.</li>
<li>Limits: up to 10 tickets for most matches; 6 for Australia pool games, the semi-finals and the final. No child tickets for the semis or final.</li>
<li>Buy as one order under one account if your group wants to sit together. Separate accounts won't be seated together.</li>
</ul>
<p class="muted">Sources: <a href={T.info} target="_blank" rel="noopener">official tickets page</a>, <a href={T.howto} target="_blank" rel="noopener">official ticket buying guide</a>.</p>
<h2>⚠️ Scam warnings</h2>
<ul class="warn">
<li>Don't buy from social media sellers, marketplaces or unofficial resale sites. Those tickets can be cancelled and you'll be refused entry.</li>
<li>Reselling outside the official platform is against the ticket conditions; a resold ticket used at the gate can be refused.</li>
<li>Check the web address: official ticketing is <b>tickets.rugbyworldcup.com</b>. Official emails come from <b>noreplyrwc2027@rugbyworldcup.com</b>.</li>
<li>Be wary of "guaranteed" final tickets or travel packages from companies not on the official agent list.</li>
<li>Never pay by bank transfer to individuals or share your ticketing login.</li>
</ul>
</Base>
